{
  "schemaVersion": "payment_block_oracles_v1",
  "contract": ["All financial quantities and prices are exact rational strings or separate numerator/denominator columns.","One block amount is quantityScale * q / quantityDivisor * (priceMultiplier * p + priceAdder) * quoteMultiplier; its PV multiplies the explicit discount.","Block selection chooses rows to contribute; it never recalibrates declared quantity divisors or a shape's original calibration window.","Quantity samples already use MWh, including quarter-hour rows. No duration conversion is implied.","Scenarios are immutable source-version transformations; applying one may not change base source columns or the block.","The optional priceConstruction oracle separately qualifies one named affine-shape primitive; a kernel consuming resolved price columns alone does not prove that primitive.","These synthetic primitive cases do not replace the production policy for interval capacity in force, corrections, lifecycle or settlement."],
